	"data": "Journal — 2026-04-02 11:44\n\nSummary\n\nThe speaker records during their commute to a senior design job fair, reflecting on their OpenClaw journal UI project's technical struggles. They discuss debugging challenges with their AI assistant Calcifer, plans to implement automated testing and CI/CD deployment pipelines to a Raspberry Pi 5, and a strategic shift toward a more hands-on AI collaboration model where they write code incrementally with Calcifer's guidance rather than relying on full AI…",
